# Per-sandbox Caddy vhost snippets (sb-<name>.caddy) are written here at
# runtime by scripts/deploy.sh and removed by scripts/sandbox_down.sh.
# This directory is bind-mounted into the caddy container at
# /etc/caddy/sandboxes and imported by caddy/Caddyfile. Kept in git so the
# mount source exists on a fresh checkout; the generated *.caddy files are
# gitignored.
